{
 "id": "person-daniel-soul",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/person-daniel-soul",
 "offset_seconds": -1.960000000000214,
 "words_heard": 256,
 "words": 263,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Taken from Jerusalem, a young man far from home",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Babylon had golden halls and gods of wood and stone",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They set the king's food on his table, poured the king's own wine",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Daniel resolved in his heart",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not to defile himself",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three times a day he got down on his knees and prayed",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Giving thanks to his God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just as he had always done",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Kings may rise and kings may fall",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He kept on praying through it all",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The king dreamed of a statue made of gold and iron and clay",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A stone not cut by human hands came and broke it all away",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Daniel blessed the God of heaven who knows what lies in the dark",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He changes times and seasons",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He removes kings and sets up kings",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At Belshazzar's feast a hand wrote letters on the wall",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The cups of gold were shaking and the king began to fall",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have been weighed on the scales and found too light",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the kingdom ended in the dark of that same night",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three times a day he got down on his knees and prayed",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Giving thanks to his God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just as he had always done",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Kings may rise and kings may fall",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He kept on praying through it all",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They threw him in the lions' den and sealed it with a ring",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And sleep fled from the palace, sleep fled from the king",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At the first light of dawn the king got up and hurried to the lions' den",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 16,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My God sent his angel and shut the mouths of the lions",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
